---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { href, profile } from '../site';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="Privacy, browser storage and contact information for Matěj Teplý's personal website."
>
  <article class="privacy wrap">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>
      Updated 5 October 2026. This personal portfolio is maintained by Matěj Teplý (Majkey).
      Contact: <a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email}</a>.
    </p>
    <h2>Website and browser storage</h2>
    <p>
      The site has no analytics, advertisements, registration, purchase flow, or contact form. Fonts
      are served with the site. GitHub Pages hosts the site and processes technical requests,
      including IP addresses, for delivery and security. GitHub's{' '}
      <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">
        privacy statement
      </a>{' '}
      explains its retention, international transfers, and privacy contacts.
    </p>
    <p>
      Your chosen colour theme is saved in local storage until you clear this site's browser data. A
      session-storage flag remembers that the introduction has played, until the tab session ends.
      Neither is sent to the maintainer. The site does not set advertising or analytics cookies.
      Your browser's site-data controls can remove these preferences; browsing still works when
      storage is blocked.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact and your rights</h2>
    <p>
      If you email me, I use your address and message to answer and document your request, based on
      my legitimate interest in responding to correspondence. Messages are retained only while
      needed for that purpose or applicable legal obligations. Do not send secrets or sensitive
      personal information.
    </p>
    <p>
      Use the email above to request access, correction, deletion, restriction, or object to
      processing of personal information I hold. Portability applies where provided by law. You may
      also complain to the <a href="https://uoou.gov.cz/">Czech data protection authority</a> or
      your local authority. For GitHub's hosting records, contact GitHub through its privacy
      statement.
    </p>
    <h2>Links and project information</h2>
    <p>
      External profiles, projects, and source repositories have their own operators and policies.
      Following a link contacts that service. This portfolio does not sell products or
      subscriptions; product-specific prices, terms, and privacy notices belong to the linked
      project.
    </p>
    <h2>Font licenses</h2>
    <p>
      Mona Sans and Geist Mono use the SIL Open Font License. The distributed notices are available
      for <a href={href('mona-sans-license.txt')}>Mona Sans</a> and
      <a href={href('geist-license.txt')}>Geist Mono</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .privacy {
    max-width: 52rem;
    padding-block: 4rem;
  }
  h1 {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  p {
    margin-block: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
</style>
